\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The four interfaces trade robot-specific detail for abstraction and selective focus. The Joint-Space Sequence{} serializes calibrated joint states; the Cartesian-Space Sequence{} serializes link/EE poses and uses IK; the Motion Program{} emits factorized \texttt  {pose} and \texttt  {path} symbols; and the Trajectory Sketching{} emits sparse EE/base-path handles retargeted by a controller.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:interfaces}{{1}{1}{}{}{}}
