\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces No single interface preserves the cue-bearing factors on every embodiment. Rows show Humanoid air quotes, Tiago point self, IIWA raise index one moment, Stretch stretch arms up, and Roomba depict lion; columns compare human-authored GT, Joint-Space Sequence{}, Cartesian-Space Sequence{}, Motion Program{}, and Trajectory Sketching{}. Paths mark the active EE or base handle, and O/X denotes recognition.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
